   "duration": 2.05,
   "text": "Your AI agents are units!",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "offset": 2.3,
   "at": 4.3
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_intro_3.wav",
   "id": "vo_intro_3",
   "section": "intro",
   "duration": 1.94,
   "text": "GBrain is their shared memory!",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "offset": 4.45,
   "at": 6.45
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_intro_4.wav",
   "id": "vo_intro_4",
   "section": "intro",
   "duration": 2.12,
   "text": "River forges new unit types!",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "offset": 6.65,
   "at": 8.65
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_intro_5.wav",
   "id": "vo_intro_5",
   "section": "intro",
   "duration": 1.9,
   "text": "This is QM RAID!",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "offset": 8.9,
   "at": 10.9
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_orders_1.wav",
   "id": "vo_orders_1",
   "section": "orders",
   "duration": 5.36,
   "text": "Hear ye, hear ye! Order a knight, a real QM agent, to a camp.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "select",
   "offset": 1.3,
   "at": 14.3
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_orders_2.wav",
   "id": "vo_orders_2",
   "section": "orders",
   "duration": 6.91,
   "text": "Blue beam: first it checks the Library, our GBrain. Then it works the issue. For real.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "recall_beam",
   "offset": 8.86,
   "at": 21.86
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_orders_3.wav",
   "id": "vo_orders_3",
   "section": "orders",
   "duration": 3.43,
   "text": "Gold orb: what it learned goes back on the shelf.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "remember_orb",
   "offset": 17.97,
   "overrun": 0,
   "at": 30.97
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_teams_1.wav",
   "id": "vo_teams_1",
   "section": "teams",
   "duration": 5.94,
   "text": "Three units? That's a team. Form the Trio: planner, implementer, reviewer.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "select3",
   "offset": 1.3,
   "at": 36.3
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_teams_2.wav",
   "id": "vo_teams_2",
   "section": "teams",
   "duration": 6.47,
   "text": "Right-click a camp, and the scrolls fly. The reviewer checks the work against the house rules.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "handoff",
   "offset": 8.52,
   "at": 43.52
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_teams_3.wav",
   "id": "vo_teams_3",
   "section": "teams",
   "duration": 3.12,
   "text": "Verdict: approved! The camp falls.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "verdict",
   "offset": 16.28,
   "overrun": 0,
   "at": 51.28
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_forge_1.wav",
   "id": "vo_forge_1",
   "section": "forge",
   "duration": 6.4,
   "text": "Need a unit nobody has? To the Forge! River fine-tunes a model on practice orders.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "forge_open",
   "offset": 1.3,
   "at": 56.3
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_forge_2.wav",
   "id": "vo_forge_2",
   "section": "forge",
   "duration": 5.8,
   "text": "Refund Ranger, Rule Warden: each beats its base model on held-out test orders.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "card",
   "offset": 9.66,
   "at": 64.66
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_forge_3.wav",
   "id": "vo_forge_3",
   "section": "forge",
   "duration": 1.97,
   "text": "Train one, and out it walks!",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "train",
   "offset": 17.43,
   "overrun": 0,
   "at": 72.43
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_auto_1.wav",
   "id": "vo_auto_1",
   "section": "autopilot",
   "duration": 3.1,
   "text": "A new issue? A fresh camp appears on the map.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "new_issue",
   "offset": 1.3,
   "at": 76.3
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_auto_2.wav",
   "id": "vo_auto_2",
   "section": "autopilot",
   "duration": 8.56,
   "text": "Autopilot proposes orders, each with a fifteen second veto ring. Object now, or forever hold your peace.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "proposed",
   "offset": 7.84,
   "overrun": 0,
   "at": 82.84
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_loadout_1.wav",
   "id": "vo_loadout_1",
   "section": "loadout",
   "duration": 4.74,
   "text": "Every knight carries a loadout: standing orders, skills, and plugins.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "loadout_open",
   "offset": 1.3,
   "at": 93.3
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_loadout_2.wav",
   "id": "vo_loadout_2",
   "section": "loadout",
   "duration": 3.93,
   "text": "Rewrite its standing orders right here, mid-battle.",
   "engine": "eleven",
   "anchor": "save",
   "offset": 7.47,
   "overrun": 0,
   "at": 99.47
  },
  {
   "file": "vo_end.wav",
   "id": "vo_end",
